<title>USA: Reliastar Q4 net higher on stronger sales.</title>
<headline>Reliastar Q4 net higher on stronger sales.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ReliaStar Financial Corp on Tuesday said marketing strategies and expense management helped net income increase in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings of $49.3 million, up from $38.4 million in the same period of 1995. Revenues rose to $565.9 million from $542.1 million.</p>
<p>ReliaStar is a holding company that provides insurance, retirement and personal finance education services.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
